      "thinking": "Let me think about this. Opponent is attacking with Master Pakku, a 2/4. I have Curious Farm Animals 1/1 that can block. If I block, my 1/1 dies, I gain 3 life, and Pakku survives. Blocking a 2/4 with a 1/1 means I take 0 damage instead of 2, gain 3 life when it dies. Net life swing: instead of going to 18, I stay at 20 and gain 3 = 23. That's a 5 life swing. But I lose my Curious Farm Animals, which has a useful sacrifice ability (destroy artifact/enchantment for {2}).\n\
