\n\
Actually, with Pakku being a 2/4, my 1/1 doesn't trade. The question is whether 5 life is worth more than the 1/1 body. I'd say yes, generally blocking a 2-power attacker with a 1/1 that gains you 3 life on death is a good trade early. But my hand is land-heavy and I need creatures. Losing my only creature means Sokka comes down to an empty board (though Sokka makes tokens when I cast noncreature spells).\n\
