\n\
But would they block that way? They'd trade Katara for Sokka — probably yes, that's good for them.\n\
\n\
So stunning Katara is better for combat: their double-block is Pakku + Jeong Jeong = 3 damage to Sokka 4/4 (survives), Sokka kills Pakku (3 damage) + 1 to Jeong Jeong. \n\
