      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent has Pakku and Katara out, tapped out after attacking last turn. I have Waterskin + 3 lands, casting Sokka this turn as planned. Playing Sun-Blessed Peak first is wrong (tapped); I need an untapped land. Actually with Waterskin I have 4 mana: Plains, Mountain, North Pole Gates, Waterskin. Sokka costs 1URW — I can cast right now without playing a land. I'll play Island first (free, doesn't change mana), then cast Sokka using Mountain (R), North Pole Gates (U or W), Plains (W/U), Waterskin for the 1.",
