      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent untapped, slammed a second Boar-q-pine, then copied Octopus Form via Jeong Jeong's exhaust to hit me for 12 (I'm at 6). Their board is tapped out or summoning sick, leaving only Katara (5/6) and Pakku (1/3) as blockers. My 1/1 and 2/2 attack into exactly one lethal double-block possibility — I'm gambling they don't set up the Katara+Pakku double block on the 2/2; even if they do, I still have 5 power and 3 cards coming next turn.",
        "attackers": "p62,p71",
        "rationale": "Opponent is at 9 with only Katara and Pakku able to block. If they don't double-block my 2/2, at least 1 damage gets through and I have Treetop Freedom Fighters (3 haste damage) to follow up. I can't afford to sit back at 6 life — I must press the race now.",
      },
